---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact Mitchell Haw | SEO & AI Search Consultant"
  description="Reach out to Mitchell Haw for SEO consulting, AI search visibility, local SEO, technical SEO, content strategy, website migrations, and organic search growth help."
>
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <p class="section-label">Contact</p>

        <h1>
          Reach out about SEO, AI search visibility, or improving how your business gets found online.
        </h1>

        <p>
          Whether you need help with local SEO, technical SEO, content strategy,
          AI search visibility, or a broader organic search plan, feel free to send
          over some details about your business and what you are trying to improve.
        </p>

        <a
          href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc8-OP6SW3D1AjAc0HUYMB5bq5DySUd0B76N4_lUFI_twafJw/viewform?usp=publish-editor"
          class="primary-btn"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Contact Me
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <h2>Areas I commonly help with</h2>

        <p>
          I work with businesses looking to improve visibility across Google,
          local search, AI-powered search experiences, and the broader web.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>SEO strategy and organic growth planning</li>
          <li>AI search visibility and generative search strategy</li>
          <li>Local SEO and Google Business Profile guidance</li>
          <li>Technical SEO audits and recommendations</li>
          <li>Website migrations and SEO transition planning</li>
          <li>Service page and location page strategy</li>
          <li>Site structure and internal linking improvements</li>
          <li>Content strategy and search intent planning</li>
          <li>Analytics, reporting, and visibility reviews</li>
          <li>Video and YouTube search strategy</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Based in Bend, Oregon</h2>

        <p>
          I work with businesses in Bend and Central Oregon as well as companies
          operating across larger regional, national, and multi-location markets.
        </p>

        <p>
          If you already know where things feel stuck, include that in your message.
          If not, that is completely fine too.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
